# Identity UI build-time settings — copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in.
# Every variable here is PUBLIC: SvelteKit bakes `PUBLIC_*` into the client
# bundle, so nothing secret belongs in this file.
#
# All are optional and an empty `.env` is fine for `pnpm dev`.

# Reown Cloud (formerly WalletConnect Cloud) project id. Without it the wallet
# picker offers no WalletConnect, only the injected wallets and Coinbase Wallet.
# It chooses which Reown project the pairings are counted against and
# allowlisted by.
#
# Get one free at https://dashboard.reown.com and register every origin you
# serve from (http://localhost:5500 for `pnpm dev`). Reown's allowlist is meant
# to keep a project's relay to the origins it names, so an origin the project
# does not name may not be able to pair at all.
# PUBLIC_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=

# Account-bus signaling server (docs/Account-Bus.md). `pnpm dev` falls back to
# the local server on ws://localhost:5520; a production build with this unset
# runs with no account bus at all — which is what the GitHub Pages previews do,
# on purpose. Only the DigitalOcean build sets it.
# PUBLIC_BUS_SIGNALING_URL=
